I did some more testing, and found that the following monsters follow when
level-teleporting:

All      A,T,V,W,Z,&,i,t,
Plus  ghost, gremlin, zruty, stalker, shopkeeper, watchman, watch captain,
and all soldiers.

L,M,Q,h,l,n and elves surprisingly didn't follow.

Neither did C,D,H,N,O,Y,u.

I didn't bother testing a lot of unintelligent monsters.

The above monsters will follow whether you change levels because of cursed
scroll of teleportation, cursed potion of gain level, orb of fate invocation,
or wizard-mode level teleport.

I hope this helps someone!

-Brian



